<del></del></span> Heroic Dungeon Gear for Destruction Warlock</span></h2>This list represents the best gear available strictly from Heroic dungeons in Phase 3 of Mists of Pandaria Classic. However, it is essential to remember that because other gear may be obtained at a higher item level from raids, crafting, World Bosses, etc., it is not an actual "best in slot" list. Instead, it's more of a rough guideline, and players should simulate the gear they have available to determine their best combination of stats and effects.<br/>
<br/>
