<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="world-drops">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c9" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/expansionicon_mistsofpandaria.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best World Drop Items for Destruction Warlock</span></h2>Mists of Pandaria brings a wealth of world content, offering the chance to acquire powerful gear. This includes Rare mobs, like <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=50350/morgrinn-crackfang">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Morgrinn Crackfang</span></a>, but also World Bosses, such as <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=60491/sha-of-anger">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sha of Anger</span></a>.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="nalak">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c9" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_pandarenserpentmount_lightning_blue.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Nalak</span></h3>Nalak replaces Sha of Anger in terms of relevant item drops. You can get 2 pieces of your Tier 15 set, including <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95325/gloves-of-the-thousandfold-hells">
<img alt="Gloves of the Thousandfold Hells" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_cloth_raidwarlock_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gloves of the Thousandfold Hells</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95327/leggings-of-the-thousandfold-hells">
<img alt="Leggings of the Thousandfold Hells" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pant_cloth_raidwarlock_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leggings of the Thousandfold Hells</span></a>. Additionally, the loot pool again includes some Tyrannical Gladiator's Gear and the Mount <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95057/reins-of-the-thundering-cobalt-cloud-serpent">
<img alt="Reins of the Thundering Cobalt Cloud Serpent" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pandarenserpentmount_lightning_blue.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reins of the Thundering Cobalt Cloud Serpent</span></a>.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95325/gloves-of-the-thousandfold-hells">
<img alt="Gloves of the Thousandfold Hells" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_cloth_raidwarlock_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gloves of the Thousandfold Hells</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95327/leggings-of-the-thousandfold-hells">
<img alt="Leggings of the Thousandfold Hells" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pant_cloth_raidwarlock_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Leggings of the Thousandfold Hells</span></a></div></li></ul>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="oondasta">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c9" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/ability_mount_triceratopsmount_blue.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Oondasta</span></h3>Oondasta drops a lot of powerful 522 item-level gear, which, for the most part, will be part of your Pre-Raid BiS and will even replace some old Tier 14 offpieces. The most interesting drops for Warlocks are <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95164/eye-of-oondasta">
<img alt="Eye of Oondasta" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_45.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Eye of Oondasta</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95185/terrorful-weave">
<img alt="Terrorful Weave" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_cloth_raidwarlock_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Terrorful Weave</span></a>, but also plenty of other items.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95183/waistband-of-elder-falcarius">
<img alt="Waistband of Elder Falcarius" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_robe_cloth_raidwarlock_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Waistband of Elder Falcarius</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95194/gloves-of-tyranomancy">
<img alt="Gloves of Tyranomancy" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_cloth_raidmage_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Gloves of Tyranomancy</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95184/girdle-of-dimorphodontics">
<img alt="Girdle of Dimorphodontics" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_cloth_raidpriest_m_01belt.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Girdle of Dimorphodontics</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95185/terrorful-weave">
<img alt="Terrorful Weave" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_cloth_raidwarlock_m_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Terrorful Weave</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95181/amulet-of-the-titanorex">
<img alt="Amulet of the Titanorex" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_127.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Amulet of the Titanorex</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95164/eye-of-oondasta">
<img alt="Eye of Oondasta" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_45.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Eye of Oondasta</span></a></div></li></ul>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="galleons-warband">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c9" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_mushanbeastmount.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Galleon's Warband</span></h3>World Boss drops have a much higher item level than Valor or Reputation gear, making them excellent pre-raid upgrades. These pieces often replace gear listed above and should be used unless they break a Tier 14 set bonus.<br/>
<br/>Galleon's Warband is notable because it drops some of our best pieces in <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90435/ring-of-wretched-flames">
<img alt="Ring of Wretched Flames" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_145.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ring of Wretched Flames</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90430/stomphowl-pendant">
<img alt="Stomphowl Pendant" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_108.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stomphowl Pendant</span></a>.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90449/belt-of-detonation">
<img alt="Belt of Detonation" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_cloth_raidwarlock_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Belt of Detonation</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90439/open-steppe-sandals">
<img alt="Open Steppe Sandals" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boot_bracer_raidmage_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Open Steppe Sandals</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90418/robes-of-the-lightning-rider">
<img alt="Robes of the Lightning Rider" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_robe_raidmage_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Robes of the Lightning Rider</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90409/sky-sear-cowl">
<img alt="Sky-Sear Cowl" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_helmet_cloth_raidwarlock_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sky-Sear Cowl</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90435/ring-of-wretched-flames">
<img alt="Ring of Wretched Flames" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_ring_145.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ring of Wretched Flames</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90429/necklace-of-imbued-fury">
<img alt="Necklace of Imbued Fury" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_95.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Necklace of Imbued Fury</span></a></div></li></ul>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="sha-of-anger">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c9" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/sha_spell_fire_felfirenova.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Sha of Anger</span></h3>The <a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=60491/sha-of-anger">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sha of Anger</span></a> is a valuable early target, as it drops 496-iLvl Tier 14 legs and gloves, along with various 483-iLvl Malevolent Gladiator PvP pieces. If you're lucky, this can give you a strong head start on your tier set.<br/>
<br/>While primarily PvP gear, some of the Malevolent Gladiator items can be upgrades in PvE, depending on your current gear. Be sure to check your options using the <a data-contiguous="true" href="https://www.wowsims.com/mop/warlock/destruction/#" target="_blank">Destruction Warlock Sim</a> to see what's best.<br/>
<br/>Additionally, the first time you kill the Sha of Anger, it will drop <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89317/claw-of-anger">
<img alt="Claw of Anger" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_hand_1h_shaclaw.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Claw of Anger</span></a>, which can be turned in for <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90913/sandals-of-the-shadow">
<img alt="Sandals of the Shadow" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_boots_cloth_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sandals of the Shadow</span></a>, a solid early pair of boots to help round out your gearing.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=85369/sha-skin-gloves">
<img alt="Sha-Skin Gloves" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_glove_cloth_raidwarlock_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sha-Skin Gloves</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=85371/sha-skin-leggings">
<img alt="Sha-Skin Leggings" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_raidwarlock_l_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Sha-Skin Leggings</span></a></div></li></ul>
<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="rare-mobs">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c9" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/expansionicon_mistsofpandaria.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Rare Mobs</span></h3>There are tons of Rare mobs scattered around Pandaria, and each one has a unique drop. Most of these are toys, cosmetics, or similar items, but a small handful can drop strong equipment.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=50338/kornas-nightsavage">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Kor'nas Nightsavage</span></a> drops <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87642/darkstaff-of-annihilation">
<img alt="Darkstaff of Annihilation" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_staff_2h_pandung_c_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Darkstaff of Annihilation</span></a>, a 440-iLvl weapon.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a data-entity="npc" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/npc=50768/cournith-waterstrider">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Cournith Waterstrider</span></a> drops <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=90721/cournith-waterstriders-silken-finery">
<img alt="Cournith Waterstrider's Silken Finery" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_pants_cloth_reputation_c_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Cournith Waterstrider's Silken Finery</span></a>, 440-iLvl legs.</div></li></ul>
<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="reputation">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c9" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_faction_shadopan_assault.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Reputation Items for Destruction Warlock</span></h2>
<div class="wh-center" style="text-align: -webkit-center;">
<div class="wh-wrapper" style="--wh-wrapperWidth: 600px;">
<div class="markup-grid exclude-units">
<button class="wh-button" data-active="true" data-checked="true" data-style="cta" data-variation="wow-death-knight">
<span class="wh-button-icon">
<img src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/pvpcurrency-honor-horde.jpg"/></span>
<span class="wh-button-text">Horde</span></button>
<br/>
<button class="wh-button" data-checked="false" data-style="cta" data-variation="wow-death-knight">
<span class="wh-button-icon">
<img src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/ui_alliance_7legionmedal.jpg"/></span>
<span class="wh-button-text">Alliance</span></button></div></div></div>
<br/>
<br/>Phase 3 introduces some new reputations, the most noteworthy of which is <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1435/shado-pan-assault">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Shado-Pan Assault</span></a>. This reputation offers 522 item-level pieces for various gear slots, the same item-level as loot attained from Throne of Thunder in the normal difficulty. However, the reputation is earned only within the raid, meaning at best you can get <a class="q4 icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=95146/destroyers-battletags">
<img alt="Destroyer's Battletags" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelry_necklace_132.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Destroyer's Battletags</span></a> before raiding.<br/>
<br/>The other factions introduced are <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1388/sunreaver-onslaught">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Sunreaver Onslaught</span></a> for Horde, and <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1387/kirin-tor-offensive">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Kirin Tor Offensive</span></a>  for Alliance. These faction-specific reputations offer 489 item-level loot.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="sunreaver-onslaught-and-kirin-tor-offensive">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c9" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_faction_sunreaveronslaught.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Sunreaver Onslaught and Kirin Tor Offensive <span class="iconmedium" data-color="c9" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_reputation_kirintor_offensive.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span></span></h3>
<div class="" data-option-active="true">
<div class="wh-center" style="text-align: -webkit-center;">
